          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ni Bakabona Abakulu n'Abanamateeka boona baamuduula nga bakoba bati: “Yawonianga abandi, mwene tasobola kwewonia! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti ni Kurisito kyabazinga wa Isiraeli, mperaano aike ave ku musalaba tubone era twikirize.” Bale be baamukomerera nabo boona baamuvuma!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
