              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu yaagula olugoye olweru, yaamughanula ku musalaba, yaamuzinga mu lugoye, yaamuta mu magombe, agaali gasimiibwa mu lubaale yaagalangula eibaale yaalita mu mulyango ogw'amagombe.",
          "type": "text",
